#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: description
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"A brief introduction to the course structure, intended audience, and to the "
"variational quantum eigensolver."
msgstr "コースの構成、対象者、および変分量子固有値ソルバーについての簡単な紹介。"

#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: sidebar_label
#, no-wrap
msgid "Introduction"
msgstr "はじめに"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"{/* cspell:ignore Lipinska allowfullscreen webkitallowfullscreen "
